{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-blackbirds-city-noise","revision":1,"title_en":"A Blackbird’s Song on Two Sides of Vienna","title_zh":"维也纳两端的黑鸟鸣声","level":"B2","primary_topic":"psychology_science","tags":["science","animals"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"维也纳城市与林地黑鸟的鸣声存在音高和时间差异，科学家通过实地比较与声音实验探讨鸟类应对城市噪声的可能方式。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T09:47:07Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"A blackbird singing in central Vienna may have traffic underneath its song.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"在维也纳市中心鸣叫的乌鸫，其鸣声下方可能伴随着车流声。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"A","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一只"},{"start":2,"end":11,"surface":"blackbird","lemma":"blackbird","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"乌鸫；黑鸫"},{"start":12,"end":19,"surface":"singing","lemma":"sing","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"鸣叫；歌唱"},{"start":20,"end":22,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之中"},{"start":23,"end":30,"surface":"central","lemma":"central","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"市中心的；中央的"},{"start":31,"end":37,"surface":"Vienna","lemma":"Vienna","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"维也纳"},{"start":38,"end":41,"surface":"may","lemma":"may","pos":"情态动词","gloss_zh":"可能"},{"start":42,"end":46,"surface":"have","lemma":"have","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"伴有；具有"},{"start":47,"end":54,"surface":"traffic","lemma":"traffic","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"车流；交通噪声"},{"start":55,"end":65,"surface":"underneath","lemma":"underneath","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……下方；衬在……背景下"},{"start":66,"end":69,"surface":"its","lemma":"its","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"它的"},{"start":70,"end":74,"surface":"song","lemma":"song","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸣声；鸟鸣"}],"phrases":[{"start":23,"end":37,"surface":"central Vienna","gloss_zh":"维也纳市中心"}]},{"id":"s2","text":"A blackbird in woodland outside the city has a different set of sounds to compete with.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"而在城外林地里的乌鸫，面对的则是另一组需要与之竞争的声音。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"A","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一只"},{"start":2,"e